Oops, with NO_INDEX_MERGE range access is gone?


MariaDB, latest patch:

{code}
MariaDB [j21]>  explain select * from t2 where c3<1 and (c2=4 or c3=6) ;
+------+-------------+-------+--------------+---------------+-------+---------+------+--------+---------------------------------+
| id   | select_type | table | type         | possible_keys | key   | key_len | ref  | rows   | Extra                           |
+------+-------------+-------+--------------+---------------+-------+---------+------+--------+---------------------------------+
