+------+-------------+-------+--------------+---------------+-------+---------+------+--------+---------------------------------+
1 row in set (0.002 sec)
{code}
Ok

{code}
MariaDB [j21]> explain select /*+ NO_INDEX_MERGE(t2 c2,c3) */ * from t2 where c3<1 and (c2=4 or c3=6) ;
+------+-------------+-------+------+---------------+------+---------+------+------+-------------+
| id   | select_type | table | type | possible_keys | key  | key_len | ref  | rows | Extra       |
+------+-------------+-------+------+---------------+------+---------+------+------+-------------+
|    1 | SIMPLE      | t2    | ALL  | c2,c3         | NULL | NULL    | NULL | 2000 | Using where |
