This is because the table->covering_keys should remain \{0\}, but the logic above causes it be updated to \{1\}.

This is because it simply accounts in vcol expressions or fields in the select list when updating covering_keys:

{code:c++}
// update_vcol_key_covering:
  while ((item= it++))
  {
    if ((vcol_field= is_vcol_expr(ctx, item)) ||
