out of which lines 352, 879, and 1607 belong to cleanups, and the rest to the feature.
So, apparently the MTR tests don't use big enough vectors to hit this code. 

The attached [^vec2.test] reduces the missing coverage to 7 lines, out of which 4 belong to the feature and 3 to cleanups:
{noformat:title=MTR + vec2 missing coverage for the patch from the baseline 6a2afb42ba86188ccda0972f9c2df363f34e10a0 -- the feature + cleanups}
