{noformat}

The attached [^vec1.test] reduces the missing coverage to 4 lines, out of which 1 belongs to the feature and 3 to cleanups:
{noformat:title=MTR + vec1 missing coverage for the patch from the baseline 6a2afb42ba86188ccda0972f9c2df363f34e10a0 -- the feature + cleanups}
