I implemented a new ANALYZE FORMAT=JSON field "partitions_index_scan_method", with possible values "none", "ordered" and "unordered" at base. It turned out only one test is affected: main.explain_json_format_partitions. It also turned out that the PARTITION BY RANGE (c % 5) with ORDER BY (c % 5) uses unordered scan both before and after the patch. See below

{noformat}
fc3332cf5da upstream/bb-main-mdev-37330 MDEV-37330 [poc] Set to use unordered index scan when PARTITION BY RANGE item is identical to ORDER BY item
20b35160709 MDEV-37330 [wip] Add a test
